# Defensive: raw ML training datasets (Kaggle CSVs, Kelmarsh SCADA zips,
# etc.) should never be committed — they're multi-hundred-MB and are
# only ever needed locally, once, when running
# backend/scripts/ml/train_*.py. If you download one, keep it outside
# this repo folder, or it'll get caught here if you don't.
backend/scripts/ml/data/
*.csv
